title: Languages the app does not know are coloured by the grammars their extension brings (JSON or a property list, an embedded language, an injection), deep in a long file and while typing, and Rust looks as it always did
folders: grammars
extensions: grammar-extension
expect-log: grammars of extensions: 4 \(for 4 file names and extensions\)
expect-log: the grammar of quill coloured src/hello\.quill: 21 of its 21 lines tokenized
expect-log: the grammar of quill coloured big/long\.quill: 6000 of its 6000 lines tokenized
expect-log: the grammar of ink coloured notes/story\.ink: 8 of its 8 lines
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 2: comment only the grammar of its extension\. · keyword TODO · comment : more -\}
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 3: keyword module · type Greeter$
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 5: keyword let · ident greeting · punct : · type Text · punct = · string "hello, \\"world\\""$
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 8: keyword fun · function greet · punct \( · ident name · punct : · type Text · punct \) · punct -> · type Text · punct \{$
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 15: comment -- a line comment, FIXME later$
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 17: heading === · heading start · heading ===$
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 18: ident Hello · ident there · punct \. · keyword -> · function meet$
expect-log: script: colours of Quillfile line 3: keyword give · function build · punct \( · ident target · punct , · number 3 · punct \)$
expect-log: script: colours of src/main\.rs line 2: keyword let · ident answer · punct = · number 42 · punct ; · comment // the answer$
expect-log: script: colours of notes/story\.ink line 2: heading === · heading meet · heading ===$
expect-log: script: colours of notes/story\.ink line 4: keyword \* · ident Knock · keyword -> · function knock$
expect-log: script: colours of big/long\.quill line 3003: comment let value_3002: Number = 3002 -- line 3003$
expect-log: script: colours of big/long\.quill line 3006: keyword let · ident value_3005 · punct : · type Number · punct = · number 3005 · comment -- line 3006$
expect-log: script: colours of big/long\.quill line 5990: keyword let · ident value_5989 · punct : · type Number
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 11: comment \{-  \}$
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 12: comment give greeting$
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 21: comment fun shout
expect-log: script: colours of src/hello\.quill line 12: keyword give · ident greeting$
forbid-log: the grammar of rust
forbid-log: grammar .* (is left out|cannot be used|cannot be read|is not a property list|is in a format)
expect-file: grammars/src/hello.quill :: (?m)^  \}\n  give greeting$

resize 1600 1000
wait 3000
colours Quillfile 1
goto src/hello.quill
wait 2500
mark quill
wait 500
colours src/hello.quill 2
colours src/hello.quill 3
colours src/hello.quill 5
colours src/hello.quill 8
colours src/hello.quill 15
colours src/hello.quill 17
colours src/hello.quill 18
colours src/main.rs 2
colours Quillfile 3
goto notes/story.ink
wait 2000
mark ink
wait 500
colours notes/story.ink 2
colours notes/story.ink 4
goto big/long.quill
wait 4000
colours big/long.quill 3003
colours big/long.quill 3006
colours big/long.quill 5990
mark long
wait 500
goto src/hello.quill
wait 1500
tool edit
edit src/hello.quill 11 1
type {-
colours src/hello.quill 11
colours src/hello.quill 12
colours src/hello.quill 21
mark typed
wait 500
key undo
colours src/hello.quill 12
key save
wait 500
quit
